        "created_at": "2019-07-12T18:40:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As I recall the rough history of the '80s, after the FCC deregulated&nbsp;kids' TV, it was Hasbro looking to market its line of transforming/combining toys from Japan that jump-started the toy wave; I imagine that Shear Force arose as a reaction to those transforming and combining robots.</p>",
